{"answer_text":"For a five-person team you want something that's quick to set up, keeps the pipeline visible and doesn't need an admin. These are the strongest options right now: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell**: Easy to adopt, but email features cost extra. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: The safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Great for outbound-heavy teams, overkill if you mostly handle inbound leads. [4]\n\nIn short, trial Pipewell and Northwind CRM side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-509d-76e0-b4ff-e742be86ac10","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:01.050Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["best crm for small sales team 2026","crm for 5 person team pricing","easiest crm small business reviews"],"latency_ms":4660,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[172,180],[463,471]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[238,251],[476,489]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[348,361]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relatio